","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/04/01/2798460/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"構えて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/04/01/2798460/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登ってみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか初！袴でテンション高すぎたみたい(  ꒪⌓꒪  )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこの公開収録の書道パフォーマンスでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるは桜の花びらと、ただひとりの新緑の葉っぱと、\nまいやんのフォローをさせてもらったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎはちゃんと筆で書きたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どすっとね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/04/01/2798460/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤毛の写真、びっくりしたー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´艸`)(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールだからって\nちょっくら嘘つきになってみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´艸`)(*´艸`)(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれね、パチンって髪に留めるやつで\nままの妹が貸してくれたんよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたら頭に付けられてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びびった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/04/01/2798460/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷはー"},{"